# xhci_hcd xhci_pci usb_storage uas usbcore mmc_core mmc_block sdhci sdhci_pltfm sdhci_brcmstb bcm2835_dma dw_axi_dmac_platform rp1 rp1_pcie
for MODULE in squashfs overlay loop ext4 isofs intel-lpss-pci spi-pxa2xx-pci spi-pxa2xx-platform apple-bce applespi xen-blkfront overlayfs
